🏋️ Gym Website

A modern and responsive gym website built to showcase fitness services, attract clients, and provide essential information about a gym business.

🚀 Features:
🏠 Home Page – Clean landing page with gym introduction and highlights
💪 Services Page – Displays available fitness programs and training options
🗣️ Reviews Page – Shows customer feedback and testimonials
📞 Contact Page – Allows users to get in touch easily
⚡ Interactive UI – JavaScript-powered interactions for better user experience
📱 Responsive Design – Works on mobile, tablet, and desktop
🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5 – Structure of the website
CSS3 – Styling and layout
JavaScript – Interactivity and dynamic behavior

📂 Project Structure
📁 Gym Website
│── index.html        # Home page
│── services.html     # Services page
│── reviews.html      # Reviews page
│── contact.html      # Contact page
│── main.js           # JavaScript functionality
🎯 Purpose

This project was created as a client website for a gym business.
It demonstrates the ability to build a multi-page responsive website with a clean UI and structured layout.

🔧 How to Run
1. Download or clone the repository
2. Open index.html in your browser
3. Navigate through different pages

📌 Future Improvements
1. Add backend for contact form
2. Integrate booking or membership system
3. Improve animations and UI effects
4. Add SEO optimization
